immediately trustworthy, and action-driving. Every section must serve a functional purpose. No decorative excess. Every pixel earns its place.\n\n---\n\n## 📐 GLOBAL LAYOUT SPECIFICATIONS\n\n```\nMax Content Width:         1280px (centered, auto margins)\nSection Horizontal Padding: 80px desktop / 40px tablet / 20px mobile\nGrid System:               12-column CSS Grid\nGutter Width:              24px\nBorder Radius — Cards:     8px\nBorder Radius — Buttons:   4px\nBorder Radius — Inputs:    4px\nBox Shadow — Cards:        0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.07)\nBox Shadow — Hover Cards:  0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.13)\nTransition Speed:          0.25s ease-in-out (all interactive elements)\nSection Vertical Padding:  100px top/bottom (desktop)\n                           60px top/bottom (tablet)\n                           40px top/bottom (mobile)\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🔤 GLOBAL TYPOGRAPHY SYSTEM\n\n```\nFont Family — All:         Inter (Google Fonts — import both weights)\n\nH1:  Inter 800, 64px/72px line-height, letter-spacing -1.5px, color #000000\nH2:  Inter 700, 44px/52px line-height, letter-spacing -1px, color #000000\nH3:  Inter 700, 28px/36px line-height, letter-spacing -0.5px, color #000000\nH4:  Inter 600, 22px/30px line-height, letter-spacing -0.3px, color #000000\nH5:  Inter 600, 18px/26px line-height, color #000000\nH6:  Inter 600, 16px/24px line-height, color #000000\n\nBody Large:   Inter 400, 18px/28px line-height, color #3D3D3D\nBody Regular: Inter 400, 16px/26px line-height, color #3D3D3D\nBody Small:   Inter 400, 14px/22px line-height, color #6B6B6B\nCaption:      Inter 500, 12px/18px line-height, color #6B6B6B, letter-spacing 1.5px,\n              UPPERCASE\n\nLabel/Tag:    Inter 600, 12px/16px, letter-spacing 2px, UPPERCASE, color #000000\n\nButton Primary Text:   Inter 600, 15px/20px, letter-spacing 0.5px\nButton Secondary Text: Inter 600, 15px/20px, letter-spacing 0.5px\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🎨 COMPLETE COLOR PALETTE\n\n```\n— PRIMARY SURFACES —\nBackground Primary:    #FFFFFF (main page background)\nBackground Secondary:  #F8F8F8 (alternating section backgrounds)\nBackground Tertiary:   #F2F2F2 (card backgrounds, input fields)\nBackground Dark:       #000000 (dark section backgrounds, footer)\nBackground Dark Alt:   #111111 (footer sub-sections, dark cards)\n\n— TEXT COLORS —\nText Primary:          #000000 (headings, high-emphasis)\nText Secondary:        #3D3D3D (body copy, paragraphs)\nText Tertiary:         #6B6B6B (captions, meta, secondary labels)\nText Inverse:          #FFFFFF (text on dark backgrounds)\nText Muted:            #9B9B9B (placeholder text, disabled states)\n\n— INTERACTIVE COLORS —\nButton Primary BG:         #000000\nButton Primary Text:       #FFFFFF\nButton Primary Hover BG:   #222222\nButton Secondary BG:       #FFFFFF\nButton Secondary Border:   #000000\nButton Secondary Text:     #000000\nButton Secondary Hover BG: #000000\nButton Secondary Hover Text: #FFFFFF\n\n— ACCENT / UTILITY —\nDivider Line:          #E8E8E8\nCard Border:           #EBEBEB\nIcon Background:       #F2F2F2\nStar Rating Color:     #000000 (filled) / #D9D9D9 (empty)\nBadge Background:      #000000\nBadge Text:            #FFFFFF\nTag Background:        #F2F2F2\nTag Text:              #000000\nSuccess Indicator:     #1A1A1A (checkmark icons — keep monochrome)\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🔘 GLOBAL BUTTON SYSTEM\n\n```\nPRIMARY BUTTON:\n  Background:    #000000\n  Text:          #FFFFFF\n  Font:          Inter 600, 15px\n  Padding:       14px 32px\n  Border-Radius: 4px\n  Border:        none\n  Hover BG:      #222222\n  Hover Shadow:  0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.20)\n  Transition:    0.25s ease\n  Icon:          Optional right-arrow (→) icon, 16px, white\n\nSECONDARY BUTTON (OUTLINED):\n  Background:    transparent\n  Text:          #000000\n  Border:        2px solid #000000\n  Font:          Inter 600, 15px\n  Padding:       12px 30px\n  Border-Radius: 4px\n  Hover BG:      #000000\n  Hover Text:    #FFFFFF\n  Transition:    0.25s ease\n\nGHOST 