ctive link\nTransition:         color 0.2s ease\n\nNAVIGATION LINKS (in order):\n  1. \"Home\"          → #hero\n  2. \"Services\"      → #services\n  3. \"Why Us\"        → #why-choose-us\n  4. \"How It Works\"  → #how-it-works\n  5. \"Reviews\"       → #testimonials\n  6. \"Service Areas\" → #service-areas\n  7. \"Contact\"       → #contact\n\nDropdown Behavior (Services):\n  \"Services\" link has a dropdown indicator (chevron-down icon, 12px)\n  On hover: dropdown panel appears\n  Dropdown Panel:\n    Background:    #FFFFFF\n    Border:        1px solid #E8E8E8\n    Border-Radius: 8px\n    Box-Shadow:    0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.10)\n    Padding:       20px\n    Width:         240px\n    Items:         List of service names (from Services Grid section)\n    Item Font:     Inter 500, 14px, #3D3D3D\n    Item Hover:    Background #F8F8F8, color #000000\n    Item Padding:  10px 16px\n    Transition:    opacity 0.2s, transform 0.2s (slide down 4px)\n```\n\n## 📱 RIGHT ZONE — CTA + MOBILE TOGGLE\n\n```\nDESKTOP RIGHT ZONE:\n  Phone Number Display:\n    Icon:          Phone SVG icon, 16px, #000000\n    Text:          \"(555) 123-4567\"\n    Font:          Inter 600, 15px, #000000\n    Layout:        Flex row, align-center, gap 6px\n    Margin-Right:  24px\n\n  CTA Button:\n    Text:          \"Book a Repair\"\n    Style:         PRIMARY BUTTON (see global button system)\n    Size:          Padding 12px 24px (slightly compact for nav)\n\nMOBILE (≤768px):\n  Hide: Center navigation links, phone number\n  Show: Hamburger menu icon (3 horizontal lines, 20px, #000000)\n  Hamburger Tap: Opens full-screen mobile menu overlay\n\nMOBILE MENU OVERLAY:\n  Background:    #FFFFFF\n  Position:      Fixed, full viewport (100vw × 100vh)\n  Z-Index:       999\n  Animation:     Slide in from right, 0.3s ease\n  Close Button:  X icon, top-right, 24px, #000000\n  Nav Links:     Stacked vertically, center-aligned\n                 Font: Inter 600, 24px, #000000\n                 Padding: 20px