t, gap 6px\nText:          \"TRUSTED APPLIANCE REPAIR EXPERTS\"\nMargin-Bottom: 24px\n```\n\n### H1 Main Headline\n```\nText:          \"Fast, Reliable Appliance Repair — Right at Your Doorstep\"\nFont:          Inter 800, 64px/72px\nColor:         #000000\nLetter-Spacing: -1.5px\nMax-Width:     620px\nMargin-Bottom: 24px\n\nRESPONSIVE:\n  Tablet (≤1024px): 48px/56px\n  Mobile (≤768px):  36px/44px, letter-spacing -0.8px\n```\n\n### Subheadline / Value Proposition\n```\nText:          \"We repair all major home appliances — washers, dryers, refrigerators,\n                dishwashers, ovens, and more. Same-day service available. Certified\n                technicians. 100% satisfaction guaranteed.\"\nFont:          Inter 400, 18px/28px\nColor:         #3D3D3D\nMax-Width:     540px\nMargin-Bottom: 36px\n```\n\n### Trust Signals Row\n```\nLayout:        Flex row, gap 24px, align-center, flex-wrap\nMargin-Bottom: 40px\n\nTRUST SIGNAL 1:\n  Icon:   Checkmark SVG, 16px, #000000\n  Text:   \"Same-Day Service\"\n  Font:   Inter 500, 14px, #3D3D3D\n\nTRUST SIGNAL 2:\n  Icon:   Shield SVG, 16px, #000000\n  Text:   \"90-Day Warranty\"\n  Font:   Inter 500, 14px, #3D3D3D\n\nTRUST SIGNAL 3:\n  Icon:   Star SVG, 16px, #000000\n  Text:   \"5-Star Rated\"\n  Font:   Inter 500, 14px, #3D3D3D\n\nTRUST SIGNAL 4:\n  Icon:   Clock SVG, 16px, #000000\n  Text:   \"Available 7 Days a Week\"\n  Font:   Inter 500, 14px, #3D3D3D\n\nSeparator between signals: Vertical line, 1px solid #D9D9D9, height 16px\n```\n\n### CTA Button Group\n```\nLayout:        Flex row, gap 16px, align-center\nMargin-Bottom: 48px\n\nBUTTON 1 (Primary):\n  Text:        \"Book a Repair Now\"\n  Style:       PRIMARY BUTTON\n  Size:        Padding 16px 36px, font 16px\n  Icon:        Right-arrow (→) SVG, 16px, white, margin-left 8px\n\nBUTTON 2 (Secondary):\n  Text:        \"Call (555) 123-4567\"\n  Style:       SECONDARY BUTTON (outlined)\n  Size:        Padding 14px 32px, font 16px\n  Icon:        Phone SVG, 16px, #000000, margin-right 8px\n\nMOBILE: Stack buttons vertically, full-width each\n```\n\n### Social Proof Micro-Element\n```\nLayout:        Flex row, align-center, gap 12px\n\nAvatar Stack:\n  3–4 circular avatar images (real-looking customer photos)\n  Size:        36px × 36px each, border-radius 50%\n  Border:      2px solid #FFFFFF\n  Overlap:     -10px margin-left on each subsequent avatar\n  Background:  #F2F2F2 (fallback if no image)\n\nRating Text Block:\n  Stars:       5 filled star SVGs, 14px each, #000000, gap 2px\n  Text:        \"4.9/5 from 500+ happy customers\"\n  Font:        Inter 500, 14px, #3D3D3D\n```\n\n## 🖼️ RIGHT COLUMN — HERO VISUAL\n\n```\nContainer:\n  Position:      Relative\n  Width:         100%\n  Height:        560px (desktop)\n  Border-Radius: 12px\n  Overflow:      Visible (to allow floating cards to extend)\n\nPRIMARY HERO IMAGE:\n  Content:       Professional appliance repair technician in uniform working\n                 on a washing machine or refrigerator in a clean home kitchen\n                 setting. Technician should appear confident, professional,\n                 wearing branded uniform. Bright, well-lit scene.\n  Width:         100%\n  Height:        100%\n  Object-Fit:    Cover\n  Border-Radius: 12px\n  Box-Shadow:    0 16px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.12)\n\nFLOATING STAT CARD 1:\n  Position:      Absolute, bottom -24px, left -32px\n  Background:    #000000\n  Border-Radius: 10px\n  Padding:       20px 24px\n  Box-Shadow:    0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.20)\n  Content:\n    Number:      \"2,500+\"\n    Font:        Inter 800, 28px, #FFFFFF\n    Label:       \"Repairs Completed\"\n    Font:        Inter 400, 13px, #CCCCCC\n  Width:         180px\n\nFLOATING STAT CARD 2:\n  Position:      Absolute, top 32px, right -32px\n  Background:    #FFFFFF\n  Border:        1px solid #E8E8E8\n  Border-Radius: 10px\n  Padding:       16px 20px\n  Box-Shadow:    0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.10)\n  Content:\n    Icon:        Clock SVG, 24px, #000000\n    Number:      \"Same Day\"\n    Font:        Inter 700, 18px, #000000\n    Label:       \"Service Available\"\n    Font:        Inter 400, 12px, #6B6B6B\n  Width:         160px\n```\n\n## 📊 HERO BOTTOM BAR (OPTIONAL — BELOW HERO COLUMNS)\n\n```\nLayout:        Full-width strip below hero content\nBackground:    #F8F8F8\nBorder-Top:    1px solid #E8E8E8\nPadding:       24px 80px\nDisplay:       Flex row, justify-content space-between, align-center\n\nContent:       4 stat items separated by vertical dividers\n  Stat 1: \"15+ Years\" / \"In Business\"\n  Stat 2: \"50+ Brands\" / \"We Service\"\n  Stat 3: \"Same Day\" / \"Availability\"\n  Stat 4: \"90-Day\" / \"Parts Warranty\"\n\nEach Stat Item:\n  Number/Value: Inter 700, 22px, #000000\n  Label:        Inter 400, 13px, #6B6B6B\n  Layout:       Flex column, align-center\n  Divider:      1px solid #D9D9D9, height 40px (between items)\n```\n\n---\n\n---\n\n# SECTION 3: SERVICES GRID\n\n---\n\n## 📌 SECTION IDENTITY\n```\nSection ID:        #services\nBackground:        #F8F8F8\nPadding:           100px 80px (desktop)\nLayout:            Centered content column with section header + card grid below\n```\n\n## 🏷️ SECTION HEADER BLOCK\n\n```\nLayout:        Centered text block, max-width 640px, margin 0 auto 64px\n\nPre-Label:\n  Text:        \"WHAT WE FIX\"\n  Font:        Inter 600, 12px, #000000, letter-spacing 2px, UPPERCASE\n  Margin-Bottom: 12px\n\nH2 Heading:\n  Text:        \"Expert Repair Services for Every Appliance in Your Home\"\n  Font:        Inter 700, 44px/52px, #000000\n  Letter-Spacing: -1px\n  Margin-Bottom: 20px\n\nSubtext:\n  Text:        \"From refrigerators to washing machines, our certified technicians\n                are trained to diagnose and repair all major home appliances quickly\n                and affordably.\"\n  Font:        Inter 400, 18px/28px, #3D3D3D\n  Max-Width:   560px\n  Margin:      0 auto\n```\n\n## 🃏 SERVICES CARD GRID\n\n```\nGrid Layout:   3 columns × 3 rows = 9 service cards (desktop)\n               2 columns (tablet ≤1024px)\n               1 column (mobile ≤768px)\nGap:           24px\n```\n\n### INDIVIDUAL SERVICE CARD ANATOMY\n\n```\nCard Container:\n  Background:    #FFFFFF\n  Border:        1px solid #EBEBEB\n  Border-Radius: 8px\n  Padding:       36px 32px\n  Box-Shadow:    0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.07)\n  Transition:    transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease\n  Cursor:        Pointer\n\nCard Hover State:\n  Transform:     translateY(-4px)\n  Box-Shadow:    0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.13)\n  Border-Color:  #000000\n\nCard Internal Layout (top to bottom):\n  1. Icon Container\n  2. Service Name (H4)\n  3. Short Description\n  4. \"Learn More\" Ghost Link\n\nICON CONTAINER:\n  Background:    #F2F2F2\n  Width:         56px, Height: 56px\n  Border-Radius: 8px\n  Display:       Flex, align-center, justify-center\n  Margin-Bottom: 24px\n  Icon:          SVG appliance icon, 28px × 28px, #000000\n  Hover:         Background #000000, icon color #FFFFFF (transition 0.25s)\n\nSERVICE NAME:\n  Font:          Inter 700, 20px/28px, #000000\n  Margin-Bottom: 12px\n\nSHORT DESCRIPTION:\n  Font:          Inter 400, 15px/24px, #6B6B6B\n  Margin-Bottom: 20px\n\n\"LEARN MORE\" LINK:\n  Font:          Inter 600, 14px, #000000\n  Style:         Ghost button / text link\n  Icon:          → arrow, appears on hover, slides in from left\n  Underline:     1px solid #000000 on hover\n  Transition:    0.2s ease\n```\n\n### 9 SERVICE CARDS — COMPLETE CONTENT\n\n```\nCARD 1 — REFRIGERATOR REPAIR:\n  Icon:          Refrigerator SVG\n  Name:          \"Refrigerator Repair\"\n  Description:   \"Not cooling? Making strange noises? We diagnose and fix all\n                  refrigerator issues — compressor, thermostat, ice maker, and more.\n                  All major brands serviced.\"\n  Link:          \"Learn More →\"\n\nCARD 2 — WASHING MACHINE REPAIR:\n  Icon:          Washing machine SVG\n  Name:          \"Washing Machine Repair\"\n  Description:   \"From drum